Mobile: SDD

Purpose:
  Mobile testing — verify mobile app behavior across platforms and
  devices. Mobile tests cover native features, gestures, offline
  behavior, and platform-specific concerns.

Owns: ./

Scope:
  Native features (camera, GPS, notifications)
  Gestures and touch interactions
  Offline behavior and sync
  Push notifications
  Deep linking
  App lifecycle (background/foreground)
  Platform-specific behavior (iOS/Android)

Principles:
  Test on real devices when possible
  Test offline and online behavior
  Test platform-specific features separately
  Keep platform-specific tests organized
  Test app lifecycle events

Structure:
  Every mobile test MUST:
    test a specific mobile feature or behavior
    clean up app state
    handle platform differences explicitly
    be independent of other tests

Frameworks:
  React Native: Jest, Detox
  Flutter: flutter_test, integration_test
  iOS: XCTest, XCUITest
  Android: Espresso, UI Automator

Navigation:
  Project: @project/project.sdd
  Workflow: @workflow/testing.sdd
  TestLevels: @levels.sdd
  TestTypes: @types.sdd
  TestGates: @gates.sdd
  BDD: @bdd.sdd
  Unit: @unit.sdd
  E2E: @e2e.sdd
  UI: @ui.sdd
  ProjectTesting: @projects/vkard.az/testing/INDEX.sdd

State: +
  